{"id":"abf2842401216bb7","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-auxiliary-pda-semantics.md","title":"辅助 PDA 的有界配置与空栈接受","display":"df-auxiliary-pda-semantics — 辅助 PDA 的有界配置与空栈接受","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-auxiliary-pda-semantics","aliases":["73-df-auxiliary-pda-semantics"],"display":"df-auxiliary-pda-semantics — 辅助 PDA 的有界配置与空栈接受","depends_on":["[[73-df-auxiliary-pda-structure]]","[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]"],"source_id":"HU1979","source_ref":"§14.1, pp. 378–379; scans 386–387; explicit bounded configuration semantics","source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§14.1, pp. 378–379; scans 386–387; explicit bounded configuration semantics","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"outside-third-edition","third_edition_relation":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-auxiliary-pda-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-auxiliary-pda-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-auxiliary-pda-semantics — 辅助 PDA 的有界配置与空栈接受"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"de705f36b12feaff\" href=\"?note=de705f36b12feaff\" title=\"73-df-auxiliary-pda-structure\">73-df-auxiliary-pda-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§14.1, pp. 378–379; scans 386–387; explicit bounded configuration semantics"},{"key":"source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§14.1, pp. 378–379; scans 386–387; explicit bounded configuration semantics"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定有效 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,K,b,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,\\lhd,\\rhd)\">\\(A=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,K,b,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,\\lhd,\\rhd)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"de705f36b12feaff\" href=\"?note=de705f36b12feaff\" title=\"73-df-auxiliary-pda-structure\">73-df-auxiliary-pda-structure</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=|w|\">\\(n=|w|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell=s(n)\">\\(\\ell=s(n)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_w=\\langle\\lhd\\rangle w\\langle\\rhd\\rangle\">\\(J_w=\\langle\\lhd\\rangle w\\langle\\rhd\\rangle\\)</span>。闭包见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a>。一步关系的参数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(q,i,T,h,\\gamma),(p,i\\prime,T\\prime,h\\prime,\\gamma\\prime)\\in\\operatorname{AConf}_{A,s,w}\">\\((q,i,T,h,\\gamma),(p,i\\prime,T\\prime,h\\prime,\\gamma\\prime)\\in\\operatorname{AConf}_{A,s,w}\\)</span>；这些分量分别从其所属配置中读取，不使用未绑定的环境变量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}auxiliary\\text{-}pda\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{AConf}_{A,s,w}\\coloneqq Q\\times\\{0,\\ldots,n+1\\}\\times\\Gamma^{\\ell}\\times\\{0,\\ldots,\\ell-1\\}\\times K^*\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}auxiliary\\text{-}pda\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{AConf}_{A,s,w}\\coloneqq Q\\times\\{0,\\ldots,n+1\\}\\times\\Gamma^{\\ell}\\times\\{0,\\ldots,\\ell-1\\}\\times K^*\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}auxiliary\\text{-}pda\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}(q,i,T,h,\\gamma)\\to_{A,s,w}(p,i\\prime,T\\prime,h\\prime,\\gamma\\prime)\\leftrightarrow\\exists X\\in K\\;\\exists\\beta,\\alpha\\in K^*\\;\\exists c\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists d,e\\in\\{-1,0,1\\}\\;[&amp;\\gamma=X\\beta\\land\\gamma\\prime=\\alpha\\beta\\\\&amp;\\land(p,c,\\langle d,e\\rangle,\\alpha)\\in\\delta(q,J_w(i),T(h),X)\\land i\\prime=i+d\\land h\\prime=h+e\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,\\ell-1\\}\\;((j=h\\Longrightarrow T\\prime(j)=c)\\land(j\\ne h\\Longrightarrow T\\prime(j)=T(j)))].\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}auxiliary\\text{-}pda\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}(q,i,T,h,\\gamma)\\to_{A,s,w}(p,i\\prime,T\\prime,h\\prime,\\gamma\\prime)\\leftrightarrow\\exists X\\in K\\;\\exists\\beta,\\alpha\\in K^*\\;\\exists c\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists d,e\\in\\{-1,0,1\\}\\;[&amp;\\gamma=X\\beta\\land\\gamma\\prime=\\alpha\\beta\\\\&amp;\\land(p,c,\\langle d,e\\rangle,\\alpha)\\in\\delta(q,J_w(i),T(h),X)\\land i\\prime=i+d\\land h\\prime=h+e\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,\\ell-1\\}\\;((j=h\\Longrightarrow T\\prime(j)=c)\\land(j\\ne h\\Longrightarrow T\\prime(j)=T(j)))].\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}auxiliary\\text{-}pda\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\nR_{A,s,w}\\coloneqq\\{(C,D)\\in\\operatorname{AConf}_{A,s,w}^2:C\\to_{A,s,w}D\\},\\qquad C^0_{A,s,w}\\coloneqq(q_0,0,\\langle b:0\\le j&lt;\\ell\\rangle,0,\\langle Z_0\\rangle)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}auxiliary\\text{-}pda\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\nR_{A,s,w}\\coloneqq\\{(C,D)\\in\\operatorname{AConf}_{A,s,w}^2:C\\to_{A,s,w}D\\},\\qquad C^0_{A,s,w}\\coloneqq(q_0,0,\\langle b:0\\le j&lt;\\ell\\rangle,0,\\langle Z_0\\rangle)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}auxiliary\\text{-}pda\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\nL_s(A)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{AConf}_{A,s,w}\\;[\\pi_5(C)=\\varepsilon\\land(C^0_{A,s,w},C)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{AConf}_{A,s,w}}(R_{A,s,w})]\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}auxiliary\\text{-}pda\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\nL_s(A)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{AConf}_{A,s,w}\\;[\\pi_5(C)=\\varepsilon\\land(C^0_{A,s,w},C)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{AConf}_{A,s,w}}(R_{A,s,w})]\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}auxiliary\\text{-}pda\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NAPDA}_{\\Sigma}(s)\\coloneqq\\{L_s(A):\\operatorname{APDA}_{\\Sigma}(A)\\},\\qquad\\mathsf{DAPDA}_{\\Sigma}(s)\\coloneqq\\{L_s(A):\\operatorname{APDA}_{\\Sigma}(A)\\land\\operatorname{DAPDA}(A)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}auxiliary\\text{-}pda\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NAPDA}_{\\Sigma}(s)\\coloneqq\\{L_s(A):\\operatorname{APDA}_{\\Sigma}(A)\\},\\qquad\\mathsf{DAPDA}_{\\Sigma}(s)\\coloneqq\\{L_s(A):\\operatorname{APDA}_{\\Sigma}(A)\\land\\operatorname{DAPDA}(A)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>配置域阻止两读头越界；空栈没有后继且作为接受条件。此定义把工作带长度 s(n) 直接写入配置，因此在复杂度比较定理中要求 s 可构造，防止把不可计算的外部边界当成隐含信息源。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-auxiliary-pda-structure","status":"resolved","id":"de705f36b12feaff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-auxiliary-pda-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-auxiliary-pda-structure","status":"resolved","id":"de705f36b12feaff","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定有效 $A=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,K,b,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,\\lhd,\\rhd)$，见 [[73-df-auxiliary-pda-structure]]。$s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$w\\in\\Sigma^*$，$n=|w|$，$\\ell=s(n)$，$J_w=\\langle\\lhd\\rangle w\\langle\\rhd\\rangle$。闭包见 [[73-df-finite-path-closure]]。一步关系的参数满足 $(q,i,T,h,\\gamma),(p,i\\prime,T\\prime,h\\prime,\\gamma\\prime)\\in\\operatorname{AConf}_{A,s,w}$；这些分量分别从其所属配置中读取，不使用未绑定的环境变量。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定有效 $A=(Q,\\Si