\text{-}auxiliary\\text{-}pda\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\nL_s(A)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{AConf}_{A,s,w}\\;[\\pi_5(C)=\\varepsilon\\land(C^0_{A,s,w},C)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{AConf}_{A,s,w}}(R_{A,s,w})]\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}auxiliary\\text{-}pda\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NAPDA}_{\\Sigma}(s)\\coloneqq\\{L_s(A):\\operatorname{APDA}_{\\Sigma}(A)\\},\\qquad\\mathsf{DAPDA}_{\\Sigma}(s)\\coloneqq\\{L_s(A):\\operatorname{APDA}_{\\Sigma}(A)\\land\\operatorname{DAPDA}(A)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":3406,"backlinks":[{"id":"34c08ba68aabce9a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-auxiliary-pda-semantics]]"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-343","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-auxiliary-pda-semantics|辅助 PDA 的有界配置与空栈接受]]"},{"id":"7e57d0b0f778496a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}$ 满足 $\\operatorname{SpaceConstructible}(s)$ 且 $\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;s(n)\\ge\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil$。可构造性见 [[73-df-exact-work-space-construction]]，辅助机类见 [[73-df-auxiliary-pda-semantics]]，时间类见 [[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]]。输入字母表为 $\\mathbf2$。"}],"outgoing":["de705f36b12feaff","25902d0bd75ea963"]}